    },
    "body": "From the Dispatch Console: 1.  On the routes page, choose the route and click on the “pad & pencil” icon next to the primary driver’s name.    2.  Change Driver Type to “Secondary Drivers & Helpers” and select the secondary driver from the dropdown list.  Click “Save.”     From the Mobile App: 1.  Click the “Dispatch” tab.  Choose the route and click on the “pad & pencil” icon next to the primary driver’s name.    2.  Change Driver Type to “Secondary Drivers & Helpers” and select the secondary driver from the dropdown list.  Click “Save.” .         Video:  Assign a Secondary Driver/Helper to a Route",
